{"phase": "F4", "temper": true, "nyquist": true} -> transition_to_temper   | Call Foundry-Gate(phase='temper'), update state to F5
{"phase": "F5", "temper": true}                  -> run_temper             | When clean, call Foundry-Gate(phase='done'), update to F6.
{"phase": "F5", "temper": true, "nyquist": true} -> run_temper             | When clean, call Foundry-Gate(phase='nyquist'), update to F5.5.
{"phase": "F5.5", "nyquist": true}               -> run_nyquist            | When done, call Foundry-Gate(phase='done'), then Foundry-Phase(phase='nyquist_done') to enter F6.

